b63bc22bb3d41d48517def804cd561.poster.avif?t=1717761977\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834400/extras/89b63bc22bb3d41d48517def804cd561.webm?t=1717761977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834400/extras/89b63bc22bb3d41d48517def804cd561.mp4?t=1717761977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
